WEBVTT

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:03.420
I missed you!

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.170
Kotoko-san.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.810
What the...?

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.360
You’re so cold, Kotoko-san.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.780
I recognized you at first sight.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.250
By “Kotoko-san”, you mean...

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:25.280
Irie-kun! It’s not what you think! It’s a misunderstanding. He’s...

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.130
Non-chan?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.240
You’re Non-chan, right?

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.950
Non-chan?

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.300
The one in the same ward when Yuuki-kun was admitted?

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.390
It’s been a while.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.710
Naoki-san, you became a doctor.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.760
You were pretty smart after all.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.150
Are you really Non-chan?!

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:50.220
But, but... the Non-chan I knew... was like <i>this</i> small.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.930
That’s just too small.

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.470
How many years do you think have passed?

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:56.810
I’m sixteen now.

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.280
From Yuuki’s letter...

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.790
...I heard that you managed to land Naoki-san after all the pushing.

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.830
All the pushing...?

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:11.370
So that’s why you became a nurse even though it’s unthinkable.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.950
What’s that supposed to mean?!

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:18.950
Well, you couldn’t even solve fourth grade
arithmetic questions, yet you became a nurse.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:25.380
Yuuki was quite disheartened after he suddenly lost contact with you.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:27.590
I moved a short while after that time.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:29.800
How’s your health?

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.120
Same as always.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:35.200
I was referred to this hospital
for examinations.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.080
Nobuhiro.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.820
It looks like they’re ready. Let’s go.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.740
See you.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.230
Would you like to visit our house?

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.440
I’m sure Yuuki would be delighted.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.900
Okay, then I’ll come over tonight.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.680
But we have that magazine interview tonight.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.060
Just cancel it then.

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:51.710
How can I do that?

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.180
I’ll tell my family then.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.550
I can’t just cancel it like that!

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:33.730
I was surprised that you and Nobuhiro were acquaintances.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.360
When I first met him seven years ago...

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.360
...he was a docile and angelic little boy.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.200
Things wouldn’t be the same
after seven years.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:47.370
Either way, it was really wonderful to see Dr. Irie and Nobuhiro standing next to each other.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:51.330
Wasn’t it was an unbelievably
beautiful two-shot?

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:54.610
Wouldn’t be the same, huh?

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.720
Kotoko-san, it’s Yoshida-san from Room 502.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.720
Yes, is something wrong?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:05.220
Hurry... Please send someone quickly.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.580
Yoshida-san? Obaa-chan?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.350
Hurry! Hurry!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.430
I’ll be right there!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.820
Three packets of apple juice.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.090
My supply ran out.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.440
You sounded like you were in pain when you asked for someone to be sent over immediately.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:25.280
I was so thirsty that I couldn’t take it anymore, so of course I wanted someone to come immediately.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.060
Yoshida-san...

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.120
Hurry it up!

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:34.880
As usual, Yoshida-san is <i>still</i> under the impression that the nurses are her errand runners.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:39.380
It’s not like she can’t walk, so she could at least buy her own drinks!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.010
Honestly! I think I’ll scold her
one more time...

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.720
Oh my, Aihara-san?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.160
Eh?! Matsumoto Yuuko?

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.470
Why are you here?

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.310
My friend was hospitalized.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.440
Oh dear me.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.780
What?

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:58.940
I forgot to tell my friend that there’s a particular nurse to watch out for in this hospital.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.450
That attitude of yours never changes.

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:03.410
Same goes for you.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.990
What’s wrong?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.160
Nothing. I’m just a little sleep deprived.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.540
Would you like to request a vitamin supplement injection?

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.800
I don’t have time for that.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:18.420
I founded a company with a friend last month, and things have been really hectic.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.420
Company?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.970
Yeah, the one hospitalized is my co-manager.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:25.040
Oh no, look at the time.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.100
Say “hi” to Irie-kun for me, okay?

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.820
Aiming for the top even after entering society, huh?

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:31.850
Quit screwing around!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:35.440
I don’t care if you’re a star or whatever, but don’t take advantage of it!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.910
Keita? What’s all the shouting about?

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.530
He... What he did to Akiko-chan...

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.070
Akiko-chan?

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:49.950
He forcefully kissed her while I was buying a drink.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.460
Is that true, Non-chan?

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:55.230
I thought that she’d be bored from living in a hospital.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.170
So, I just gave her a little company.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.590
Non-chan!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.310
I’m incredibly famous, you know?

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:04.470
Normally, I wouldn’t bother with girls like that.

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:06.260
I guess it’s what you’d call volunteer work.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.900
Damn you!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:08.640
Kamogari-san!

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:10.090
Don’t, Keita!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.940
Let go, Kotoko!
I’m gonna beat the crap outta him!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:12.640
Don’t!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:13.940
Keita!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.020
What are you doing?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.170
Let go!

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:19.560
You can’t! He’s a patient too!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.720
That bastard!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:24.230
Wasn’t your goal to serve all patients?

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:27.110
Stop it! Kamogari-san!

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.650
It was my fault.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:35.110
He often appears in magazines, so I told him I always saw him.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.880
That’s why...

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.960
I’m sorry!

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.200
Akiko-chan...

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.900
Akiko-chan, wait!

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.220
How scary.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:57.680
Non-chan, Akiko-chan has been living in the hospital
for a long time, so she gets really nervous.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.360
Keita was trying to be considerate of that fact.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:04.490
I know what it’s like to live in a hospital for a long time...

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.570
All too well...

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.690
Hey, I’ve been looking for you.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.840
You shouldn’t be wandering around by yourself.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.540
The medical examinations are about to start, so they want you back.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.500
Yeah, yeah... Don’t get so upset over something that trivial.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.000
Non-chan!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.000
Please stop calling me Non-chan.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.160
Non-chan...

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.930
What’s happened to you?

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:29.010
Where did the kind Non-chan disappear to?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.390
Non-chan!

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.390
Hey, it’s been a while.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.140
Oh my God!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:41.480
Non-chan? Is that really you, the really tiny Non-chan?

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:46.110
You haven’t grown much, have you...

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.610
Well...

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.030
Welcome.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.580
Anyway, come on in.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.910
Now, eat up!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:01.290
I’ve been placed on a restricted diet, so I can’t eat oily foods.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.130
No need to worry.

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:06.500
I requested the food to be cooked with only a moderate amount of salt and oil.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.590
Then, shall we have a toast?

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:11.930
Okay?

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:17.220
Then, a toast to our reunion with Nobuhiro-kun. Cheers!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.990
Cheers!

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.600
Here you go.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:25.650
I never thought that you’d go into show business.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:28.230
I often appear on TV though.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:31.150
Well, our family isn’t really interested in the world of show business.

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:35.540
But, I never imagined that you’d grow up to be this handsome.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.010
If only Yuuki were a little taller.

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:42.550
There wouldn’t be anyone to take over Papa’s company if I went into show business.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:43.670
Yeah, I guess so.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.630
I’m counting on you.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:49.250
Non-chan?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.050
Toilet.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.640
What are you doing out here?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:03.270
My brother asked me to check up on you since you didn’t come back.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.340
A doctor for a brother and a company president for a father.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.420
You’re a high schooler aiming to get into college, huh?

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.500
A life without anything to complain about.

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.640
But, you’re a star though.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.280
Yeah, but my health is in shambles.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.820
But soon, the doctors...

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.290
I can’t trust doctors.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:24.210
They can’t cure my condition, but they still talk big.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:27.290
Then they have the nerve to think that they’re the greatest.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.440
Non-chan...

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.750
Even your brother.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.750
Didn’t he become a doctor
for status and money?

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:38.560
People are appreciative of him just because he’s a doctor.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.560
Try saying that again!

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:44.610
Being called “doctor” all the time must really get to his head.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.420
Don’t look down on my brother like that!

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:51.320
Non-chan?

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:52.850
What’s wrong?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:54.620
Non-chan!

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.490
Yuuki, what happened?

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.010
He... He...

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.480
Non-chan?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.070
Non-chan!

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.480
Have you come around?
We’re at the hospital.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:25.980
Ah, Yuuki did something horrible to me and I fainted.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.350
Who was the one being horrible?!

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:29.230
Yuuki-kun.

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.160
You’re right.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.590
I’m sorry, Yuuki.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:35.690
I...

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:37.850
It’s okay!

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:41.080
I know you didn’t mean it.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.620
I’m sorry too.

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:49.830
Idiot, you actually believed me!

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.560
Non-chan!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:52.870
You know...

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.960
You shouldn’t be so trusting.

00:10:56.640 --> 00:11:01.050
The people around you might not hesitate to betray you one day.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:04.180
That would never happen!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:08.500
I’ll never worry about you ever again!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.730
He’s the same as usual.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.890
Just like he was seven years ago.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:18.780
What happened to you today has happened a few times before, hasn’t it?

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.610
I’m already used to it.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.820
I’m still not fully recovered, but I don’t want to make a big fuss about it each and every time.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.210
Ah, hello.

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.250
I received a call from the office.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.670
How are you feeling?

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:32.960
Same as always.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:36.220
I’d like to keep him here for observation for a while.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:38.680
And also, I’d like to get in touch with one of his family members.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:41.470
Ah, the paperwork has already been completed by the office staff.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.920
He lives on his own.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:45.760
But, what about his parents?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.270
They’re divorced.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.690
They’ve both remarried.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.930
And Nobuhiro-san’s father has custody, but...

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.440
...his new wife just had a baby.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.240
So, he wanted to leave the house
because of that.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.550
Oh shut up!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:02.780
You don’t have to tell the whole world.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.660
But...

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.660
Non-chan hasn’t gotten better?

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.490
He did well to get as far as he has in show business.

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:17.670
It’s because Non-chan is a hard worker.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.720
He may be acting like that now...

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:25.390
...but originally, the real Non-chan had lots of tenacity.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.300
You’re right.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:31.560
Onii-chan, please cure Non-chan.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.200
Yuuki-kun...

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:42.280
I’d like Irie-san to be in charge of Kimura Nobuhiro-san.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.950
Eh? In charge of Non-chan?

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.670
Why her?!

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:50.060
It’s already too much that she has a monopoly over Dr. Irie!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.170
Why does she get Nobuhiro too?!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:53.250
Silence!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:59.070
You all get too excited around Nobuhiro-san, so someone more calm is needed for this.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.760
So, I chose Irie-san because she seems disinterested in him.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.680
Even though I may get too excited,

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.690
I’m confident that I can do a better job than Kotoko even when she’s calm!

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:07.850
The same goes for me, too!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:08.850
Hey.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.230
Well, you do have a point.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.180
Head nurse!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.970
Either way, I’ve already made my decision.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:16.690
Irie-san, I’m counting on you.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.140
Okay...

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:23.290
You’re in charge of me, Kotoko-san?

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.600
Will I be all right?

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:27.030
I don’t want to die from something other than my illness.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.910
What’s with that attitude?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.370
Here, your food.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.140
I’m sick of hospital food.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:35.380
Are you a child?

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.610
Buy me the latest issue of Only Love.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.380
I can’t sleep, so massage my shoulders.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.210
What?

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:45.620
Now, give me your arm.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:48.470
No way. I’m sure you suck at that.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:53.390
Kotoko-san, it’s a nurse call from Kimura-san.

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:59.440
He’s no longer the angel Non-chan.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.310
He’s the devil of selfishness.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:06.450
Maybe he’s asking for all of the selfish things he couldn’t ask for when he was young.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.900
Excuse me.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.490
Is there something?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.720
Will Nobuhiro make it?

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:12.660
What do you mean?

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:16.790
Filming starts next month.
Will he make it?

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:18.880
It will be hard.

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:21.110
That’s a huge problem!

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:25.350
If we had to delay filming because of him, our company’s reputation would be ruined!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:29.810
Hey! Right now, what’s most important isn’t the
company’s reputation, but Non-chan’s health, right?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.590
Well, however...

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.050
It’s okay. I’ll pull out.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.770
Things will go smoother that way.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:40.440
Hey, you can’t pull out so easily like that...

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.480
How am I supposed to report this to the president?!

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:54.280
It was a rare chance to play a leading role in a movie.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:57.070
You didn’t have to pull out.

00:14:57.070 --> 00:15:02.800
I’ve been ill so long that
I’ve lost my tenacity.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.160
I never participated in any school events before either.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:10.300
The friends that I made when I was out of the hospital...

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:14.010
...completely forgot about me when I was readmitted.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:19.250
Resignation kind of became a habit
sometime during that repetitive cycle.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:24.020
But, people began spoiling me when I became a little famous.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.490
It’s all about appearance, isn’t it?

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:29.990
That’s the only thing that connects people.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.720
Don’t...

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:34.490
Don’t say such sad things!

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.410
Do you know how I feel...

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:42.920
...with this illness of mine, growing up watching my parents fight over it all the time?!

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:46.350
I’m sick of dealing with people.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:55.680
Surgery?

00:15:56.170 --> 00:16:01.950
Drug therapy can keep your condition stable, but to be honest, improving it will be difficult.

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.950
It’ll be better to just remove the tumorous kidney.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:08.370
Dr. Irie was the one who initially proposed this idea.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.780
Dr. Irie did?

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:13.690
I will be performing the surgery and Dr. Irie will be my assistant.

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:16.780
Non-chan, please entrust us with this.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.290
I want to cure you.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.300
It’s okay. There’s no need for surgery.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.630
Why? But then...

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.560
Non-chan!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.940
This won’t work.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:36.710
No, I’m sure I can get him to accept.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.520
Irie-kun, I made some coffee.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.720
You’ll catch a cold.

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:54.820
Surely, you’re capable of
becoming a doctor, right?

00:16:56.380 --> 00:17:02.450
That way, you’ll be able to help Non-chan and many others, and they’ll all be grateful to you!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.580
You remembered, didn’t you?

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.670
I won’t accept it no matter what you tell me.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:15.470
The numbers are completely stable right now.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.470
I think this is the best time
to have the surgery.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.850
Why are you so insistent on the surgery?

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.810
Is it because you want to gain real-world experience as quickly as possible?

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:28.840
Or does my illness tickle your doctor fancy?

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.690
Do you seek recognition
from the scientific world?

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.700
Dr. Naoki, you might just profit from...

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.780
Kotoko?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.450
Cut it out!

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:43.850
Is it okay to use violence against patients?!

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:47.920
Irie-kun became a doctor for you!

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:53.940
We saw how much you suffered and endured when you were young.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:59.830
I asked Irie-kun because I knew he had the ability to become a doctor and could help you.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.930
Out of all the people he knows, you’re still special to him!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:07.390
Don’t be so spoiled and think that everyone has forgotten all about you!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:13.070
Irie-kun, Yuuki-kun and I haven’t forgotten about you, Non-chan!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.850
Quit acting like a baby!
Grow up and be a man!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:25.280
So, just accept the surgery!

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:26.740
Got it?

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:35.790
If the surgery fails and I die...

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:37.760
...then what would my life amount to?

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.530
I get scared thinking about dying like that.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.220
I can’t stand it.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.770
Anyone would be scared.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:49.150
To be honest, I’m scared... even though I’m the one who proposed the surgery.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.360
But, like Yuuki said...

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.660
...“Non-chan has a lot of tenacity.”

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:59.360
That was the first time I’ve ever been hit by someone.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.370
Dr. Naoki, you sure married someone with a lot of tenacity.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:10.370
Kotoko is incapable of doing 90% of the things that I can do.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:16.880
But, as for the 10% I can’t do, she succeeds where no one else could.

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:21.180
You’re thinking awfully hard.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:25.760
Have you been repenting because you thought you might have said too much?

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.840
Of course not.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:31.850
I was thinking that I should have smacked you one more time.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.400
I’ll accept the surgery.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:41.930
I want to get well and work.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.400
I want to go to high school too.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.830
I’m sure you can...

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:55.500
Thank you for believing in Irie-kun.

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:59.300
It’s because you said all those things to me.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.180
Oh, what a rare sight.

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.930
Is there something wrong with buying juice?

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:13.940
No. It’s just, normally you ask
Kotoko to do it.

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:18.820
I can’t ask someone who’s working hard to run errands for me.

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.160
Yuuki, that time...

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.660
I’ll be waiting for that apology.

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:32.660
I expect that apology after you’ve fully recovered, okay?

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.950
Got it.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.430
Let’s give it our all.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:51.890
Kotoko-san.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.310
What is it?

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.310
Can you hold my hand during the operation?

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:06.710
Let’s give it our all, Non...

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.030
Nobuhiro-kun.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:10.410
Non-chan is fine.

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:21.220
We shall now begin the nephrectomy of the right kidney.

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:22.260
Good luck.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.580
Non-chan...

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:31.200
When you open your eyes, I’m sure a wonderful life will be waiting for you.

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:08.950
Irie-kun, do you know what day it...?

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:10.410
Your birthday, right?

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:11.990
You’ve told me a million times.

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.120
But, this is the first time we’re celebrating it alone together, right?

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:17.690
Sheesh, I’m going ahead.

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:19.540
So let’s get dressed up and...

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:21.540
No way! Look at the time!

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:25.350
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:25.350 --> 00:23:27.120
The best present!

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:28.760
I’m definitely gonna be happy.

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:32.970
Driver, ultra super fast express please!
